  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I honestly cannot tell if this is a bug or an intentional change, but the startup screen on the Quest standalone version of VRChat is no longer in a 3D space. The screen I'm referring to is the one where the VRChat logo is shown in a gray space with particles floating in the background. This scene used to be in 3D, but now it appears to be in 2D and is somewhat disorienting honestly due to how close the VRChat logo is to the player's view. I cannot tell if this is intentional or an oversight, as the particles still are moving in a 3D space in the background.",
